'''Cammy''' (キャミィ, ''Kyamī'', '''Cammy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Cammy
|image = E 748.png
|first appearance = [[VS CAMMY (Easy)|New Challenger]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Cammy doesn't have much going for her in terms of stats, she has no [[Special Abilities]] and average stats across the board, meaning she can be outranged by most units the average player would have.  In both her New Challenger appearances she is a pushover that can easily be dealt with.

==Strategy==
This enemy has decent DPS, but isn't very tanky. Use rushers or backliners to  slowly whittle her down without much resistance. This includes units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], among others.

